	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d20r0501_bg19_end_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おうの　あゆみに　まよいは　ない
まよいごに　おうの　しかくなし</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T07:47:04" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T07:46:23" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>王の　歩みに　迷いは　無い
迷い子に　王の　資格無し</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T07:46:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T07:46:22" />
