・考古学者イベント後
・swanで新規作成</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T07:47:39" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d20r0501_bg19_end_02"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>おうの　あゆみに　まよいは　ない
ゆうきある　おうよ　さきに　すすめ▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T07:47:04" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T07:46:23" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>王の　歩みに　迷いは　無い
勇気ある　王よ　先に　進め▼</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-09-16T07:46:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
